## Interface: 16001
## Title: Tristan's Addon
## Notes: The do-everything Paladin companion for WoW Forever, with PvP: spec-aware rotation help, Blessing button with Aura and Seal hints, a Battle section (Honor & Rank, battlegrounds, PvP bar, your cooldowns and Forbearance, burst coach, world PvP), talents, gear tips, leveling, class quests, reminders and Learn the Paladin.
